id=CompanionDogs
name=Companion Dogs [ALPHA]
description=Tame a stray dog and raise a loyal companion that follows you, warns of zombies, and fights at your side, but every advantage has a price. Built for Build 42 (42.18+); works in singleplayer, co-op and dedicated servers and is safe to add to existing saves. ALPHA: five breeds so far (the Brazilian street mutt Caramelo, the German Shepherd, the Golden Retriever, the rare winter Husky and the Border Collie farm dog) plus breeding with puppies, assisted hunting, cargo saddlebags and livestock care, with more breeds and vet care on the roadmap. Obedience unlocks a trick tree: go to a spot (level 1), distract zombies (level 3), sniff out an item (level 5) and fetch it while you sleep (level 10); an untrained dog can also ignore an order, which sandbox can switch off. Multiplayer: on a co-op host, enable Companion Dogs in the main-menu Mods list (not just the in-game co-op selection) or the dog appears without its model/texture; on dedicated servers each player just needs it enabled. Chinese (简体/繁體) translation by duwenju1203. Italian translation by d4rk83 and Daniel. Japanese and Spanish translations by 一匹狼. Thai translation by momineko. Russian translation by Jackson WalWhite and MechJeb2. Ukrainian translation by MechJeb2. Korean translation by Hagaren. Vietnamese translation by huuhoa43. German translation by Katinka1988. French translation by lordtmk. ASSET USAGE: feel free to build add-ons and new breeds for Companion Dogs and to use the mod's art in them, just give proper credit; outside of that, please do not extract, repackage or redistribute the mod's content in unrelated projects without explicit permission.
